iceover - Cities Talking is the perfect travel app for smartphones and tablets (Android & Apple) - Explainer Voice by Guy Harris\",\"uploadDate\":\"2015-03-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>This time working with a  great production company in Dubai I was asked to add the Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p><em>For many years, art galleries and museums have offered ‘audio tours’ which provide an expert commentary through a pair of headphones as you walk around. Now, thanks to a savvy combination of GPS navigation and smartphones, Cities Talking offers the same principle of an expert audio guide talking you round and letting you go at your own pace.</em> Say goodbye to your bulky, out-of-date,city guide books... Cities Talking is the perfect travel app for smartphones and tablets (Android and Apple).</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YXlOKxHpS7U","title":"Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/cities-talking-explainer-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>On a daily basis I can voice several <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> or <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">web video</a> along side the daily radio ads, e-learning, TV commercials, on hold and others. It's a growing market since websites benefit from having great visual content, and since voicing the Apple iPhone TV ads, that's the voice style I get asked for most. For a couple more examples, check out my <a href=\"/crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover\" title=\"CrowdHub X Explainer\">CrowdHub X</a> and <a href=\"/rise-project-explainer-video-voiceover\" title=\"Rise Project Explainer\">Rise Project</a> explainer videos.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a voice for an Explainer Video for a web ad or company product, then please get in touch. I'm more than happy to send a short voice a sample first to see if I'm right for your project or brand. Tell me more about your brand and your project and let's see what we can achieve together!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Cities Talking Explainer Voiceover","pageUrl":"cities-talking-explainer-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","852",{"href":"/voiceover-vox-award-winner-2018","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/bl